# Everything here is EXCLUDED from the image.
#
# Two reasons this file matters:
#   1. Size  - .venv alone can be hundreds of megabytes, and it is useless in the
#              image anyway because the container installs its own.
#   2. SAFETY - without this line, your .env with real API keys gets baked into
#              the image and shipped to whoever pulls it. Say that out loud.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key

.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

.git/
.gitignore
*.md
.DS_Store
